\":\"The voice of the Ninja Warrior UK Fitbit Sponsor Bumpers on ITV. Mine and Gergia's commentator voices and a natural male voiceover for the Fitbit tag.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2022-08-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Ninja Warrior Fitbit Sponsor Bumper"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Proud to be working with ITV and Ninja Warrior UK in 2022</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The male voice of the Ninja Warrior Sponsor Bumbers</h2>\r\n<p>Kammy <a href=\"https://www.chriskamara.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chris Kamara\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chris Kamara</a> regularly uses my studio for voiceover work and he invited us to go see Ninja Warrior UK being recorded in Manchester. So much fun!<br>A week later an audition t voice the sponsor bumpers for ITV. Using my <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Commentator voice\">Commentator voice</a> I nailed the audition and got the gig. These turned out great and I love being part of the show.<br>My daughter loves the Ninja Warrior Activity Venues too.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dM8Mcofi5nI","title":"Ninja Warrior Fitbit Sponsor Bumper","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers.jpg","alt":"ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Ninja Warrior UK 2022</h2>\r\n<p>Race for Glory! After three years off our telly, Ninja Warrior UK is back for a new season as the new line-up of contestants take on an ultimate physical challenge.\r\n\r\nReturning, Ben Shephard, Chris Kamara and Rochelle Humes host the ITV gameshow, which has undergone a complete make-over during its absence – with the show looking for a male and female champion that can beat Mount Midoriyama.\r\nThe contestants have to beat the course, and this year take on Elite Ninjas in a one-on-one race in order to make it through to the next round.\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Where can I get a commentator voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>I voice so much with my Commentators voice. Football, Golf, Cricket, whatever your production I'll add that extra energy with a commentary voiceover to suit. Shoot over the details and usage and let crack on with it!\r\n</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Ninja Warrior Fitbit Sponsor Bumper","pageUrl":"ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","679",{"href":"/batelco-wifi-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/batelco-wifi-voice.jpg","alt":"Batelco WiFi Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"B